  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint: \r\nThe distance between latus rectum and equation of tangent at vertex is 'a'. Here $\\mathrm{a}=\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1+1}}=2 \\sqrt{2}$\r\nSo, length of latus rectum $=4 \\mathrm{a}=8 \\sqrt{2}$ unit",
